        {
            "format": "fullpage",
            "type": "mainPage",
            "headline": "Flat Times Officially Launches!",
            "text": [
                {
                    "text": "Welcome to the first edition of The Flat Times! Your source for news, stories and adventures across Flatland",
                    "x": 25,
                    "y": 170,
                    "width": 375,
                    "font": 22
                },
                {
                    "text": "444 days ago FlatMMO was released. It was a simple land with not many places to go, but 200 updates later we got more than 100 new enemies, new areas, and even a new skill!",
                    "x": 25,
                    "y": 320,
                    "width": 375,
                    "font": 22
                },
                {
                    "text": "Turn the page, take a break from the grind and enjoy this week's features and some awesome player creations!",
                    "x": 25,
                    "y": 470,
                    "width": 375,
                    "font": 22
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "format": "fullpage",
            "type": "featuredArea",
            "headline": "EverBrook Bank",
            "text": [
                {
                    "text": "First version of Everbrook Bank",
                    "x": 200,
                    "y": 250,
                    "font": 10
                },
                {
                    "text": "Everbrook Bank, widely known as EB, is where the adventure truly starts. Its main purpose is for Flatters to deposit and withdraw their hard-earned items.",
                    "x": 25,
                    "y": 320,
                    "font": 24
                },
                {
                    "text": "Everbrook Bank was made available for the first time about 21.5 moons ago. At that time, it allowed flatters to sell items directly inside the bank.",
                    "x": 25,
                    "y": 450,
                    "font": 24
                },
                {
                    "text": "Today, the bank is the central hub for trades, chat, and gatherings. While selling directly to townspeople is not a possibility anymore, it hosts the always competitive Global Market.",
                    "x": 630,
                    "y": 50,
                    "font": 24
                }
            ],
